{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Hy6yL5ii8rPxdkwA2EUk9t","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Booker Prize winners complete list all years\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"List of winners and nominated authors of the Booker Prize\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_winners_and_nominated_authors_of_the_Booker_Prize\"},{\"title\":\"all the booker prize winners ranked and rated\",\"url\":\"https://www.ontheprize.co.uk/all-the-booker-prize-winners-ranked-and-rated\"},{\"title\":\"Booker Prize\",\"url\":\"https://www.e-anglais.com/lectures/Booker_Prize.html\"},{\"title\":\"FICTION'S FINEST! All the Winners of the Booker Prize: 1969 to the Present\",\"url\":\"https://bookshop.org/lists/fiction-s-finest-all-the-winners-of-the-booker-prize-1969-to-the-present\"},{\"title\":\"www.teachervision.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.teachervision.com/page/1647.html\"},{\"title\":\"the complete booker prize winners list 1968 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.cegastacademy.com/the-complete-booker-prize-winners-list-1968-2023/\"},{\"title\":\"the booker prize\",\"url\":\"https://weneedtotalkaboutbooks.com/the-booker-prize/\"},{\"title\":\"The Penguin Podcast is back! Listen Now\",\"url\":\"https://penguin.co.uk/articles/booker-prize-winners-best-books\"},{\"title\":\"Has anybody read all the winners?\",\"url\":\"https://www.librarything.fr/topic/12743\"},{\"title\":\"LIST OF BOOKER PRIZE WINNERS\",\"url\":\"https://unacademy.com/content/list-of-booker-prize-winners/\"},{\"title\":\"The Complete Booker\",\"url\":\"https://anzlitlovers.com/projects/the-complete-booker/\"},{\"title\":\"the booker prize for fiction complete list of winning titles\",\"url\":\"https://pauabooks.blogspot.com/2022/01/the-booker-prize-for-fiction-complete-list-of-winning-titles.html\"},{\"title\":\"Jump to content\",\"url\":\"https://wiki.riteme.site/wiki/Booker_winners\"},{\"title\":\"The Booker Prize 2023\",\"url\":\"https://thebookerprizes.com:443/the-booker-library/features/full-list-of-booker-prize-winners-shortlisted-and-longlisted-authors\"},{\"title\":\"booker prize\",\"url\":\"https://bronasbooks.com/awards-prizes/booker-prize/\"},{\"title\":\"Booker Prize winners\",\"url\":\"https://kwx.liehendr.com/content/wikipedia_en_all_maxi_2024-01/A/Booker_Prize_winners\"},{\"title\":\"List of winners and shortlisted authors of the Booker Prize\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia-on-ipfs.org/wiki/List_of_winners_and_shortlisted_authors_of_the_Booker_Prize\"},{\"title\":\"Booker Prize\",\"url\":\"https://iiab.live/kiwix/content/wikipedia_en_simple_all_maxi_2023-01/A/Booker_Prize\"}]\n\nThe search didn't return a complete year-by-year list in its text, but it did point to several full lists:\n\n- **Wikipedia** has a [list of winners and shortlisted authors](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_winners_and_nominated_authors_of_the_Booker_Prize) covering the prize's history.\n- **The Booker Prize's own site** has a [full list of winners, shortlisted and longlisted authors](https://thebookerprizes.com:443/the-booker-library/features/full-list-of-booker-prize-winners-shortlisted-and-longlisted-authors) since the prize began.\n- **Bookshop.org** has a [list of all winners from 1969 to the present](https://bookshop.org/lists/fiction-s-finest-all-the-winners-of-the-booker-prize-1969-to-the-present), and notes that in 2019, Booker Prize judges disregarded the rule against ties imposed after 1992 and announced two winners, and that in 1992 two novels also tied.\n- **Pauabooks** has a [complete list of winning titles since 1969](https://pauabooks.blogspot.com/2022/01/the-booker-prize-for-fiction-complete-list-of-winning-titles.html). Its recent entries include Orbital by Samantha Harvey for 2024 and Prophet Song by Paul Lynch for 2023.\n\nOther points from the results: the 1969 first winner was P H Newby for *Something to Answer For* (per the [Simple Wikipedia mirror](https://iiab.live/kiwix/content/wikipedia_en_simple_all_maxi_2023-01/A/Booker_Prize)). The prize was originally called the Booker McConnell Prize and later the Man Booker Prize. The 2025 winner appears in the Bookshop list but was not named in the excerpt I saw, so check the official site for that year.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cfcc16f0-c224-4731-b65e-bd4def8e363c","uuid":"7d182581-d9f0-47e4-bae7-3c6e83e3dfc8","timestamp":"2026-11-05T07:11:16.614Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Booker Prize winners complete list all years","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01MUHYpcV7hDCq8Mq22YXFKb","content":[{"title":"List of winners and nominated authors of the Booker Prize","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_winners_and_nominated_authors_of_the_Booker_Prize"},{"title":"all the booker prize winners ranked and rated","url":"https://www.ontheprize.co.uk/all-the-booker-prize-winners-ranked-and-rated"},{"title":"Booker Prize","url":"https://www.e-anglais.com/lectures/Booker_Prize.html"},{"title":"FICTION'S FINEST! All the Winners of the Booker Prize: 1969 to the Present","url":"https://bookshop.org/lists/fiction-s-finest-all-the-winners-of-the-booker-prize-1969-to-the-present"},{"title":"www.teachervision.com","url":"https://www.teachervision.com/page/1647.html"},{"title":"the complete booker prize winners list 1968 2023","url":"https://www.cegastacademy.com/the-complete-booker-prize-winners-list-1968-2023/"},{"title":"the booker prize","url":"https://weneedtotalkaboutbooks.com/the-booker-prize/"},{"title":"The Penguin Podcast is back! Listen Now","url":"https://penguin.co.uk/articles/booker-prize-winners-best-books"},{"title":"Has anybody read all the winners?","url":"https://www.librarything.fr/topic/12743"},{"title":"LIST OF BOOKER PRIZE WINNERS","url":"https://unacademy.com/content/list-of-booker-prize-winners/"},{"title":"The Complete Booker","url":"https://anzlitlovers.com/projects/the-complete-boo